OL,3,GNEWSATravellers' camp mess causes
OL,4,Afootball club disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuge piles of rubbish have been dumped
OL,7,Fon the grounds of a women's and girls'
OL,8,Ffootball club, forcing matches to be
OL,9,Fcancelled after travellers set up an
OL,10,Fillegal camp.
OL,12,FHousehold and human waste has been left
OL,13,Fon the Downend Flyers FC's grounds at
OL,14,FPomphrey Hill Playing Fields near
OL,15,FBristol after travellers camped there
OL,16,Ffor five days.
OL,18,FSteve Poole, the club's facilities
OL,19,Fofficer, said their 350 players will
OL,20,Fhave to find alternative places to
OL,21,Ftrain until their grounds can be
OL,22,Fprofessionally cleared.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
