OL,3,GNEWSATravellers' camp mess causes
OL,4,Afootball club disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FChiefs at South Gloucestershire Council
OL,7,Fsaid they are organising the clean-up,
OL,8,Fwhich could require 10 to 15 skips,
OL,9,Fafter the travellers left the site on
OL,10,FFriday.
